# ULYS-2.2 — 任务 B: WebSocket 传输层 + 路径 /websocket (P1, 依赖 ULYS-2.1)

> 父 issue: ULYS-2 (`01a092ae-2faa-799b-b07e-ae6a9b80c166`)

## 目标
在 `crates/network-gateway` 内接入 WebSocket 传输层, 路径 `/websocket`, 端口默认 8000 (对齐原 zsyz_server `web_conn.erl` 8000).

## 输入
- ULYS-2.1 已完成的 `Frame::decode/encode` (作用于 `BytesMut`)
- tokio-tungstenite 0.21+ (需新增 Cargo.toml dep)

## 输出

### `crates/network-gateway/src/ws.rs` (新建)
```rust
pub async fn run_ws_server(addr: SocketAddr, router: Arc<dyn FrameRouter>) -> Result<()> {
    let listener = TcpListener::bind(addr).await?;
    while let Ok((stream, _)) = listener.accept().await {
        let ws = tokio_tungstenite::accept_async(stream).await?;
        tokio::spawn(handle_session(ws, router.clone()));
    }
}

async fn handle_session<W: AsyncWrite>(ws: WebSocket<W>, router: Arc<dyn FrameRouter>) {
    let mut buf = BytesMut::new();
    let (mut write, mut read) = ws.split();
    while let Some(msg) = read.next().await {
        match msg {
            Ok(Message::Binary(bin)) => {
                buf.extend_from_slice(&bin);
                while let Some(frame) = Frame::decode(&mut buf)? {
                    let resp = router.handle(frame).await;
                    let out = resp.encode();
                    write.send(Message::Binary(out)).await?;
                }
            }
            Ok(Message::Close(_)) => break,
            _ => continue,
        }
    }
}
```

### `crates/network-gateway/src/bin/main.rs` 改动
- 新增 CLI flag `--ws-addr 0.0.0.0:8000` (默认)
- 路径分流: 如果请求是 `Upgrade: websocket` + 路径 `/websocket` → WS handler
- TCP 路径保留 (现有 stub) 但默认关闭, flag `--tcp-addr 0.0.0.0:9000` 显式开启

## 验证
- [ ] `wscat -c ws://127.0.0.1:8000/websocket --no-color -x 'AAAA...'` 手工发 cmd=1199 收到回包
- [ ] `cargo test -p network-gateway --test ws_smoke` 通过 (用 tokio-tungstenite 作 client 自测)
- [ ] L1 (`cargo check --tests`) 通过

## 依赖
- ULYS-2.1 (codec)
- 新增: `tokio-tungstenite = "0.21"` (需查 workspace 锁定的具体版本, 优先复用现有)

## 工时估算
- WS 接入: 3h
- main.rs 改造 + flag: 1h
- smoke test: 1h
- **总计: 5h**
